[2026-03-14T19:55:07.973Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WHJyBsfTCpeu9AQnDHA24R","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information I need. Let me provide you with a comprehensive summary.\n\n---\n\n## Google Flights Clone - Complete Codebase Exploration\n\nI have thoroughly explored the `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights` directory. Here's a comprehensive summary of the app structure, components, tests, and infrastructure:\n\n### 1. APP STRUCTURE & ARCHITECTURE\n\n**Directory Layout:**\n- `/src` - React components, pages, Redux slices, and main app\n- `/src/components/` - 25 reusable UI components\n- `/src/pages/` - 5 main pages (SearchPage, SearchResultsPage, FlightDetailsPage, MyTripsPage, ExplorePage)\n- `/src/slices/` - Redux state management (bookingSlice, exploreSlice, flightsSlice, searchSlice, tripsSlice)\n- `/netlify/functions/` - 12 serverless backend functions\n- `/tests/` - 11 Playwright test files\n- `/docs/tests.md` - Complete test specification (1000+ lines)\n- `/scripts/` - TypeScript utility scripts (seed-db.ts, deploy.ts, test.ts, check.ts, schema.ts)\n\n**Pages:**\n1. `/` - SearchPage (flight search form)\n2. `/results` - SearchResultsPage (flight results with filters and pagination)\n3. `/booking/:id` - FlightDetailsPage (booking confirmation)\n4. `/trips` - MyTripsPage (upcoming/past/tracked trips)\n5. `/explore` - ExplorePage (explore flights/destinations)\n\n---\n\n### 2. KEY COMPONENTS\n\n**FilterSidebar.tsx** (`/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/FilterSidebar.tsx`)\n- **Functionality:** Advanced filtering sidebar with sorting, stops, airlines, price/duration range sliders, and time filters\n- **Features:**\n  - Sort dropdown (Best, Price, Duration, Departure time, Arrival time)\n  - Stops filter checkboxes (Nonstop, 1 stop, 2+ stops)\n  - Airlines filter with flight counts\n  - Price range slider with histogram\n  - Duration range slider\n  - Departure time filter (Morning, Afternoon, Evening, Night)\n  - Arrival time filter (same time windows)\n- **Custom RangeSlider component** for interactive slider controls\n- **Test IDs:** `filter-sidebar`, `sort-dropdown-button`, `filter-stops-*`, `filter-airline-*`, `price-range-*`, etc.\n- **Redux integration:** Dispatches filter state updates to flightsSlice\n\n**FlightResultCard.tsx** (`/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/FlightResultCard.tsx`)\n- **Functionality:** Displays individual flight results in a collapsible card format\n- **Features:**\n  - Airline logo (colored circle with initials) and name\n  - Departure/arrival times with day indicators (+1 for next day)\n  - Flight duration and stops information\n  - CO₂ emissions display\n  - Price display (prominently right-aligned)\n  - Expand/collapse functionality showing:\n    - Leg-by-leg breakdown with timelines\n    - Layover information and durations\n    - Terminal information\n    - Aircraft type\n    - Amenities (Wi-Fi, Power, Entertainment)\n    - Baggage allowance\n  - \"Select flight\" button for booking\n- **Test IDs:** `flight-card-${flight.id}`, `flight-card-main-${id}`, `flight-card-logo-${id}`, `flight-card-departure-${id}`, `flight-card-arrival-${id}`, `flight-card-duration-${id}`, `flight-card-stops-${id}`, `flight-card-price-${id}`, `flight-card-details-${id}`, `flight-card-leg-${id}-${leg_order}`, `flight-card-amenities-${id}`, `flight-card-baggage-${id}`, `flight-card-select-${id}`\n\n**Pagination.tsx** (`/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/Pagination.tsx`)\n- **Functionality:** Simple \"Load more\" pagination for flight results\n- **Features:**\n  - \"Load more results\" button\n  - Loading state with spinner and text\n  - Button disabled while loading\n  - Hides when all results loaded (page >= totalPages)\n- **Props:** `page`, `totalPages`, `loading`, `onLoadMore`\n- **Test IDs:** `pagination`, `pagination-load-more`, `pagination-loading`, `pagination-spinner`\n\n**SearchSummaryBar.tsx** (`/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/SearchSummaryBar.tsx`)\n- **Chip-based design** showing origin, destination, dates, passengers, cabin class\n- **Inline editors** for each parameter with inline forms\n- **Clickable chips** that trigger inline editing without page navigation\n- Test IDs: `summary-origin`, `summary-destination`, `summary-dates`, `summary-passengers`, `summary-cabin-class`\n\n---\n\n### 3. TEST SPECIFICATIONS\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/docs/tests.md` (94.6KB, comprehensive test specification)\n\n**Test Coverage by Component:**\n\n**FilterSidebar Tests (20+ tests in filter-sidebar.spec.ts):**\n- Display all filter sections\n- Stops filter (Nonstop, 1 stop, 2+ stops, multiple options, uncheck)\n- Airlines filter (showing counts, selecting single/multiple airlines)\n- Price range slider (histogram display, filtering, min/max adjustment)\n- Duration range slider\n- Departure time filter (Morning, Afternoon, Evening, Night)\n- Arrival time filter\n- Sort by dropdown (Best, Price, Duration, Departure, Arrival)\n- Combining multiple filters\n- Repeated usage\n\n**FlightResultCard Tests (15+ tests in spec):**\n- Display airline info, times, duration, stops, price, CO₂\n- Expand/collapse functionality\n- Details view (leg-by-leg breakdown, amenities, baggage)\n- Overnight flight indicators\n- Selecting flight for booking\n- Multiple card expansion\n\n**Pagination Tests (6 tests in spec):**\n- Button displayed at bottom\n- Load more appends to list\n- Button hidden when all results loaded\n- Loading state display\n- Preserves filters when loading\n- Repeated usage\n\n**Other Component Tests:**\n- TripTypeSelector (7 tests)\n- PassengerCountSelector (9 tests)\n- CabinClassSelector (7 tests)\n- AirportAutocomplete (12 tests)\n- DatePicker (10 tests)\n- SearchButton (8 tests)\n- RecentSearches (5 tests)\n- PopularDestinations (5 tests)\n- SearchSummaryBar (8+ tests)\n- TrackPricesToggle (6 tests)\n\n---\n\n### 4. EXISTING TEST FILES\n\n**Test files location:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/tests/`\n\n| File | Lines | Purpose |\n|------|-------|---------|\n| filter-sidebar.spec.ts | 396 | FilterSidebar comprehensive tests |\n| search-summary-bar.spec.ts | 261 | SearchSummaryBar inline editing tests |\n| date-picker.spec.ts | 256 | DatePicker calendar selection |\n| recent-searches.spec.ts | 261 | Recent search history |\n| search-button.spec.ts | 205 | Search form submission |\n| passenger-count-selector.spec.ts | 198 | Passenger increment/decrement |\n| track-prices-toggle.spec.ts | 196 | Price tracking toggle |\n| airport-autocomplete.spec.ts | 185 | Airport search and selection |\n| cabin-class-selector.spec.ts | 91 | Cabin class selection |\n| trip-type-selector.spec.ts | 109 | Round trip/One way/Multi-city |\n| popular-destinations.spec.ts | 81 | Popular destination grid |\n\n**Key Testing Patterns:**\n- Helper functions for building URLs with search parameters\n- Helper functions for slider dragging (dragSliderHandle)\n- Playwright fixtures with beforeEach setup\n- Data-testid assertions for all interactions\n- URL pattern matching for navigation validation\n- Timeout specifications (10000ms for async operations)\n- Comparison/sorting verification for order-dependent tests\n\n---\n\n### 5. TEST CONFIGURATION\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/playwright.config.ts`\n\n```typescript\n- testDir: './tests'\n- timeout: 60000 (per test)\n- expect timeout: 10000\n- fullyParallel: false (sequential execution)\n- retries: 0\n- workers: 1\n- baseURL: 'http://localhost:8888'\n- trace: 'on-first-retry'\n- reporter: list + json output\n- webServer: netlify dev --port 8888\n- Uses @replayio/playwright for recording\n```\n\n---\n\n### 6. PACKAGE.json & SCRIPTS\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/package.json`\n\n**Test Scripts:**\n```json\n\"test\": \"tsx scripts/test.ts\"\n\"dev\": \"vite\"\n\"build\": \"vite build\"\n\"preview\": \"vite preview\"\n\"check\": \"tsx scripts/check.ts\"\n\"deploy\": \"tsx scripts/deploy.ts\"\n```\n\n**Dependencies:**\n- React 18.3.1\n- React Router 7.1.1\n- Redux Toolkit 2.5.0\n- React Redux 9.2.0\n- Neon Database Serverless 0.10.4\n\n**Dev Dependencies:**\n- @playwright/test 1.49.1\n- @replayio/playwright 5.0.0\n- TypeScript 5.7.2\n- Vite 6.0.5\n- ESLint 9.17.0\n\n---\n\n### 7. SEED DATA & DATABASE SCHEMA\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/scripts/seed-db.ts`\n\n**Seeded Data for Testing (as of 2026-04-01):**\n\n**Flight Count:** ~200+ flights across major US/international routes\n\n**Sample Route (LAX → JFK, 2026-04-01):**\n- AA100: 08:00-16:30 (nonstop, $299 economy, 330min)\n- DL200: 10:15-18:45 (nonstop, $279, 330min)\n- UA300: 14:00-22:30 (nonstop, $319, 330min)\n- B6400: 06:00-14:30 (nonstop, $199, 330min)\n- AA101: 12:00-23:00 (1 stop at DFW, $199, 420min)\n\n**Database Structure:**\n- `airports` (~50 major airports including LAX, JFK, SFO, LHR, NRT, DXB, SIN, SYD)\n- `airlines` (~20 airlines: AA, DL, UA, BA, LH, AF, EK, SQ, etc.)\n- `flights` (flight records with departure/arrival times, aircraft, amenities, CO₂)\n- `flight_legs` (individual segments for connecting flights)\n- `prices` (cabin class pricing: economy, premium_economy, business, first)\n- `sessions`, `recent_searches`, `bookings`, `booking_passengers`, `tracked_routes`\n\n**Test Data Characteristics:**\n- Prices range from $89 (budget) to $999+ (long-haul first class)\n- Cabin multipliers: Premium 1.8x, Business 3.5x, First 6.0x\n- Tax rate: 15% on base price\n- Durations: 75 min (domestic short) to 1350 min (international with connection)\n- Amenities distributed across aircraft types\n\n---\n\n### 8. NETLIFY FUNCTIONS (Backend APIs)\n\n**File Locations:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/netlify/functions/`\n\n| Function | Purpose |\n|----------|---------|\n| search-flights.ts | Query flights with pagination, cabin class filter |\n| flight-legs.ts | Get detailed leg information for a flight |\n| airports.ts | Search airports by name/code/city |\n| bookings.ts | Create new flight bookings |\n| my-bookings.ts | Retrieve user's bookings (by session) |\n| recent-searches.ts | Save/retrieve recent search history |\n| tracked-routes.ts | Save/manage price tracking subscriptions |\n| explore-destinations.ts | Get popular destinations |\n| explore-dates.ts | Get flexible date pricing |\n| explore-deals.ts | Get current deals/promotions |\n| popular-destinations.ts | Get popular destination cards |\n| db.ts | Database connection utility |\n\n**search-flights.ts Query Pattern:**\n- Parameters: `origin`, `destination`, `departureDate`, `cabinClass`, `page`\n- Returns: `flights[]`, `total`, `page`, `totalPages`\n- Pagination: 20 results per page\n- Default sort: price ascending\n\n---\n\n### 9. COMPONENT TESTING PATTERNS\n\n**Test Helper Pattern (from filter-sidebar.spec.ts):**\n```typescript\nfunction buildResultsUrl(params?: {\n  origin?: string\n  destination?: string\n  departureDate?: string\n  cabinClass?: string\n}): string {\n  const sp = new URLSearchParams({\n    origin: params?.origin ?? 'LAX',\n    destination: params?.destination ?? 'JFK',\n    departureDate: params?.departureDate ?? '2026-04-01',\n    tripType: 'round_trip',\n    cabinClass: params?.cabinClass ?? 'economy',\n    adults: '1',\n    children: '0',\n    infants: '0',\n    returnDate: '2026-04-08',\n  })\n  return `/results?${sp.toString()}`\n}\n```\n\n**Slider Dragging Helper:**\n```typescript\nasync function dragSliderHandle(\n  page: import('@playwright/test').Page,\n  handleTestId: string,\n  trackTestId: string,\n  targetPercent: number\n) {\n  // Position handle at percentage of track\n  // Used for price/duration range filtering\n}\n```\n\n**Common Assertions:**\n- `expect(page.getByTestId(...)).toBeVisible()`\n- `expect(page.getByTestId(...)).toContainText(...)`\n- `expect(page).toHaveURL(/pattern/)`\n- `expect(element).toHaveCount(n)` for lists\n- `expect(priceArray[i]).toBeGreaterThanOrEqual(priceArray[i-1])` for sorting\n\n---\n\n### 10. REDUX STATE STRUCTURE\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/slices/flightsSlice.ts`\n\n**FlightResult interface:**\n```typescript\ninterface FlightResult {\n  id, flight_number, departure_time, arrival_time, duration_minutes,\n  aircraft_type, has_wifi, has_power, has_entertainment, co2_kg,\n  airline_name, airline_code, logo_color,\n  origin_code, origin_name, origin_city,\n  dest_code, dest_name, dest_city,\n  total_price_cents, base_price_cents, taxes_cents, cabin_class,\n  available_seats, num_legs\n}\n```\n\n**FlightLeg interface:**\n```typescript\ninterface FlightLeg {\n  id, leg_order, departure_time, arrival_time, duration_minutes,\n  flight_number, aircraft_type, terminal_departure, terminal_arrival,\n  origin_code, origin_name, origin_city,\n  dest_code, dest_name, dest_city,\n  airline_name, airline_code\n}\n```\n\n**Filter State:**\n- `sortBy`: 'best' | 'price' | 'duration' | 'departure' | 'arrival'\n- `stopsFilter`: { nonstop, oneStop, twoPlusStops }\n- `airlinesFilter`: string[] (airline codes)\n- `priceRange`: [min, max] cents\n- `durationRange`: [min, max] minutes\n- `departureTimeFilter`: { morning, afternoon, evening, night }\n- `arrivalTimeFilter`: { morning, afternoon, evening, night }\n\n---\n\n### 11. PAGES & COMPONENTS OVERVIEW\n\n**SearchPage.tsx** - Home page with:\n- TripTypeSelector\n- PassengerCountSelector\n- CabinClassSelector\n- AirportAutocomplete (origin/destination with swap)\n- DatePicker (departure/return)\n- SearchButton\n- RecentSearches section\n- PopularDestinations grid\n\n**SearchResultsPage.tsx** - Results with:\n- SearchSummaryBar (inline editable chips)\n- FilterSidebar (left sidebar)\n- Flight results list (FlightResultCard components)\n- Pagination (Load more button)\n- TrackPricesToggle\n\n**FlightDetailsPage.tsx** - Booking page with:\n- FlightSummary (selected flight details)\n- PriceBreakdown (per-passenger pricing)\n- PassengerForm (personal info collection)\n- BookingAction (confirmation button)\n\n**MyTripsPage.tsx** - Trip management with:\n- TripsTabs (Upcoming/Past/Tracked)\n- TripCard (booking display)\n- TrackedRouteCard (price tracking)\n- CancelBookingModal\n\n**ExplorePage.tsx** - Discovery page with:\n- DealsSection\n- FlexibleDatesGrid\n- DestinationMap\n- PopularDestinations\n\n---\n\n### FILE LOCATIONS SUMMARY\n\n**Key Source Files:**\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/FilterSidebar.tsx` (355 lines)\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/FlightResultCard.tsx` (262 lines)\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/Pagination.tsx` (36 lines)\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/SearchSummaryBar.tsx` (249+ lines)\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/pages/SearchResultsPage.tsx` (252+ lines)\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/slices/flightsSlice.ts` (500+ lines)\n\n**Test Specs:**\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/docs/tests.md` (1000+ lines)\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/tests/filter-sidebar.spec.ts` (396 lines)\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/tests/search-summary-bar.spec.ts` (261 lines)\n\n**Configuration:**\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/playwright.config.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/package.json`\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/vite.config.ts`\n\n**Database & Scripts:**\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/scripts/seed-db.ts` (319 lines)\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/netlify/functions/search-flights.ts`\n\nThis is a complete, production-like Google Flights clone with comprehensive testing infrastructure, real-world data patterns, and complex filtering/sorting logic!"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a46597c9942663829 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 84260\ntool_uses: 25\nduration_ms: 92115</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"755439b7-7306-4724-ae36-7d6e61e30f0f","uuid":"438b344c-01b4-4f2c-a4b4-a0e0c934b06c","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Explore the /repo/apps/google-flights directory. I need to understand:\n1. The app structure - what components exist, especially FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard, and any Pagination components\n2. The test specs in docs/tests.md - read the full file\n3. Any existing test files in the tests/ or e2e/ directory\n4. The playwright.config.ts file\n5. The package.json for test scripts\n6. The seed data or database schema\n7. The netlify functions related to flights\n\nBe very thorough - read the actual component source files for FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard, and any pagination-related components. Also read any existing test files to understand patterns used.","agentId":"a46597c9942663829","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information I need. Let me provide you with a comprehensive summary.\n\n---\n\n## Google Flights Clone - Complete Codebase Exploration\n\nI have thoroughly explored the `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights` directory. Here's a comprehensive summary of the app structure, components, tests, and infrastructure:\n\n### 1. APP STRUCTURE & ARCHITECTURE\n\n**Directory Layout:**\n- `/src` - React components, pages, Redux slices, and main app\n- `/src/components/` - 25 reusable UI components\n- `/src/pages/` - 5 main pages (SearchPage, SearchResultsPage, FlightDetailsPage, MyTripsPage, ExplorePage)\n- `/src/slices/` - Redux state management (bookingSlice, exploreSlice, flightsSlice, searchSlice, tripsSlice)\n- `/netlify/functions/` - 12 serverless backend functions\n- `/tests/` - 11 Playwright test files\n- `/docs/tests.md` - Complete test specification (1000+ lines)\n- `/scripts/` - TypeScript utility scripts (seed-db.ts, deploy.ts, test.ts, check.ts, schema.ts)\n\n**Pages:**\n1. `/` - SearchPage (flight search form)\n2. `/results` - SearchResultsPage (flight results with filters and pagination)\n3. `/booking/:id` - FlightDetailsPage (booking confirmation)\n4. `/trips` - MyTripsPage (upcoming/past/tracked trips)\n5. `/explore` - ExplorePage (explore flights/destinations)\n\n---\n\n### 2. KEY COMPONENTS\n\n**FilterSidebar.tsx** (`/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/FilterSidebar.tsx`)\n- **Functionality:** Advanced filtering sidebar with sorting, stops, airlines, price/duration range sliders, and time filters\n- **Features:**\n  - Sort dropdown (Best, Price, Duration, Departure time, Arrival time)\n  - Stops filter checkboxes (Nonstop, 1 stop, 2+ stops)\n  - Airlines filter with flight counts\n  - Price range slider with histogram\n  - Duration range slider\n  - Departure time filter (Morning, Afternoon, Evening, Night)\n  - Arrival time filter (same time windows)\n- **Custom RangeSlider component** for interactive slider controls\n- **Test IDs:** `filter-sidebar`, `sort-dropdown-button`, `filter-stops-*`, `filter-airline-*`, `price-range-*`, etc.\n- **Redux integration:** Dispatches filter state updates to flightsSlice\n\n**FlightResultCard.tsx** (`/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/FlightResultCard.tsx`)\n- **Functionality:** Displays individual flight results in a collapsible card format\n- **Features:**\n  - Airline logo (colored circle with initials) and name\n  - Departure/arrival times with day indicators (+1 for next day)\n  - Flight duration and stops information\n  - CO₂ emissions display\n  - Price display (prominently right-aligned)\n  - Expand/collapse functionality showing:\n    - Leg-by-leg breakdown with timelines\n    - Layover information and durations\n    - Terminal information\n    - Aircraft type\n    - Amenities (Wi-Fi, Power, Entertainment)\n    - Baggage allowance\n  - \"Select flight\" button for booking\n- **Test IDs:** `flight-card-${flight.id}`, `flight-card-main-${id}`, `flight-card-logo-${id}`, `flight-card-departure-${id}`, `flight-card-arrival-${id}`, `flight-card-duration-${id}`, `flight-card-stops-${id}`, `flight-card-price-${id}`, `flight-card-details-${id}`, `flight-card-leg-${id}-${leg_order}`, `flight-card-amenities-${id}`, `flight-card-baggage-${id}`, `flight-card-select-${id}`\n\n**Pagination.tsx** (`/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/Pagination.tsx`)\n- **Functionality:** Simple \"Load more\" pagination for flight results\n- **Features:**\n  - \"Load more results\" button\n  - Loading state with spinner and text\n  - Button disabled while loading\n  - Hides when all results loaded (page >= totalPages)\n- **Props:** `page`, `totalPages`, `loading`, `onLoadMore`\n- **Test IDs:** `pagination`, `pagination-load-more`, `pagination-loading`, `pagination-spinner`\n\n**SearchSummaryBar.tsx** (`/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/SearchSummaryBar.tsx`)\n- **Chip-based design** showing origin, destination, dates, passengers, cabin class\n- **Inline editors** for each parameter with inline forms\n- **Clickable chips** that trigger inline editing without page navigation\n- Test IDs: `summary-origin`, `summary-destination`, `summary-dates`, `summary-passengers`, `summary-cabin-class`\n\n---\n\n### 3. TEST SPECIFICATIONS\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/docs/tests.md` (94.6KB, comprehensive test specification)\n\n**Test Coverage by Component:**\n\n**FilterSidebar Tests (20+ tests in filter-sidebar.spec.ts):**\n- Display all filter sections\n- Stops filter (Nonstop, 1 stop, 2+ stops, multiple options, uncheck)\n- Airlines filter (showing counts, selecting single/multiple airlines)\n- Price range slider (histogram display, filtering, min/max adjustment)\n- Duration range slider\n- Departure time filter (Morning, Afternoon, Evening, Night)\n- Arrival time filter\n- Sort by dropdown (Best, Price, Duration, Departure, Arrival)\n- Combining multiple filters\n- Repeated usage\n\n**FlightResultCard Tests (15+ tests in spec):**\n- Display airline info, times, duration, stops, price, CO₂\n- Expand/collapse functionality\n- Details view (leg-by-leg breakdown, amenities, baggage)\n- Overnight flight indicators\n- Selecting flight for booking\n- Multiple card expansion\n\n**Pagination Tests (6 tests in spec):**\n- Button displayed at bottom\n- Load more appends to list\n- Button hidden when all results loaded\n- Loading state display\n- Preserves filters when loading\n- Repeated usage\n\n**Other Component Tests:**\n- TripTypeSelector (7 tests)\n- PassengerCountSelector (9 tests)\n- CabinClassSelector (7 tests)\n- AirportAutocomplete (12 tests)\n- DatePicker (10 tests)\n- SearchButton (8 tests)\n- RecentSearches (5 tests)\n- PopularDestinations (5 tests)\n- SearchSummaryBar (8+ tests)\n- TrackPricesToggle (6 tests)\n\n---\n\n### 4. EXISTING TEST FILES\n\n**Test files location:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/tests/`\n\n| File | Lines | Purpose |\n|------|-------|---------|\n| filter-sidebar.spec.ts | 396 | FilterSidebar comprehensive tests |\n| search-summary-bar.spec.ts | 261 | SearchSummaryBar inline editing tests |\n| date-picker.spec.ts | 256 | DatePicker calendar selection |\n| recent-searches.spec.ts | 261 | Recent search history |\n| search-button.spec.ts | 205 | Search form submission |\n| passenger-count-selector.spec.ts | 198 | Passenger increment/decrement |\n| track-prices-toggle.spec.ts | 196 | Price tracking toggle |\n| airport-autocomplete.spec.ts | 185 | Airport search and selection |\n| cabin-class-selector.spec.ts | 91 | Cabin class selection |\n| trip-type-selector.spec.ts | 109 | Round trip/One way/Multi-city |\n| popular-destinations.spec.ts | 81 | Popular destination grid |\n\n**Key Testing Patterns:**\n- Helper functions for building URLs with search parameters\n- Helper functions for slider dragging (dragSliderHandle)\n- Playwright fixtures with beforeEach setup\n- Data-testid assertions for all interactions\n- URL pattern matching for navigation validation\n- Timeout specifications (10000ms for async operations)\n- Comparison/sorting verification for order-dependent tests\n\n---\n\n### 5. TEST CONFIGURATION\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/playwright.config.ts`\n\n```typescript\n- testDir: './tests'\n- timeout: 60000 (per test)\n- expect timeout: 10000\n- fullyParallel: false (sequential execution)\n- retries: 0\n- workers: 1\n- baseURL: 'http://localhost:8888'\n- trace: 'on-first-retry'\n- reporter: list + json output\n- webServer: netlify dev --port 8888\n- Uses @replayio/playwright for recording\n```\n\n---\n\n### 6. PACKAGE.json & SCRIPTS\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/package.json`\n\n**Test Scripts:**\n```json\n\"test\": \"tsx scripts/test.ts\"\n\"dev\": \"vite\"\n\"build\": \"vite build\"\n\"preview\": \"vite preview\"\n\"check\": \"tsx scripts/check.ts\"\n\"deploy\": \"tsx scripts/deploy.ts\"\n```\n\n**Dependencies:**\n- React 18.3.1\n- React Router 7.1.1\n- Redux Toolkit 2.5.0\n- React Redux 9.2.0\n- Neon Database Serverless 0.10.4\n\n**Dev Dependencies:**\n- @playwright/test 1.49.1\n- @replayio/playwright 5.0.0\n- TypeScript 5.7.2\n- Vite 6.0.5\n- ESLint 9.17.0\n\n---\n\n### 7. SEED DATA & DATABASE SCHEMA\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/scripts/seed-db.ts`\n\n**Seeded Data for Testing (as of 2026-04-01):**\n\n**Flight Count:** ~200+ flights across major US/international routes\n\n**Sample Route (LAX → JFK, 2026-04-01):**\n- AA100: 08:00-16:30 (nonstop, $299 economy, 330min)\n- DL200: 10:15-18:45 (nonstop, $279, 330min)\n- UA300: 14:00-22:30 (nonstop, $319, 330min)\n- B6400: 06:00-14:30 (nonstop, $199, 330min)\n- AA101: 12:00-23:00 (1 stop at DFW, $199, 420min)\n\n**Database Structure:**\n- `airports` (~50 major airports including LAX, JFK, SFO, LHR, NRT, DXB, SIN, SYD)\n- `airlines` (~20 airlines: AA, DL, UA, BA, LH, AF, EK, SQ, etc.)\n- `flights` (flight records with departure/arrival times, aircraft, amenities, CO₂)\n- `flight_legs` (individual segments for connecting flights)\n- `prices` (cabin class pricing: economy, premium_economy, business, first)\n- `sessions`, `recent_searches`, `bookings`, `booking_passengers`, `tracked_routes`\n\n**Test Data Characteristics:**\n- Prices range from $89 (budget) to $999+ (long-haul first class)\n- Cabin multipliers: Premium 1.8x, Business 3.5x, First 6.0x\n- Tax rate: 15% on base price\n- Durations: 75 min (domestic short) to 1350 min (international with connection)\n- Amenities distributed across aircraft types\n\n---\n\n### 8. NETLIFY FUNCTIONS (Backend APIs)\n\n**File Locations:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/netlify/functions/`\n\n| Function | Purpose |\n|----------|---------|\n| search-flights.ts | Query flights with pagination, cabin class filter |\n| flight-legs.ts | Get detailed leg information for a flight |\n| airports.ts | Search airports by name/code/city |\n| bookings.ts | Create new flight bookings |\n| my-bookings.ts | Retrieve user's bookings (by session) |\n| recent-searches.ts | Save/retrieve recent search history |\n| tracked-routes.ts | Save/manage price tracking subscriptions |\n| explore-destinations.ts | Get popular destinations |\n| explore-dates.ts | Get flexible date pricing |\n| explore-deals.ts | Get current deals/promotions |\n| popular-destinations.ts | Get popular destination cards |\n| db.ts | Database connection utility |\n\n**search-flights.ts Query Pattern:**\n- Parameters: `origin`, `destination`, `departureDate`, `cabinClass`, `page`\n- Returns: `flights[]`, `total`, `page`, `totalPages`\n- Pagination: 20 results per page\n- Default sort: price ascending\n\n---\n\n### 9. COMPONENT TESTING PATTERNS\n\n**Test Helper Pattern (from filter-sidebar.spec.ts):**\n```typescript\nfunction buildResultsUrl(params?: {\n  origin?: string\n  destination?: string\n  departureDate?: string\n  cabinClass?: string\n}): string {\n  const sp = new URLSearchParams({\n    origin: params?.origin ?? 'LAX',\n    destination: params?.destination ?? 'JFK',\n    departureDate: params?.departureDate ?? '2026-04-01',\n    tripType: 'round_trip',\n    cabinClass: params?.cabinClass ?? 'economy',\n    adults: '1',\n    children: '0',\n    infants: '0',\n    returnDate: '2026-04-08',\n  })\n  return `/results?${sp.toString()}`\n}\n```\n\n**Slider Dragging Helper:**\n```typescript\nasync function dragSliderHandle(\n  page: import('@playwright/test').Page,\n  handleTestId: string,\n  trackTestId: string,\n  targetPercent: number\n) {\n  // Position handle at percentage of track\n  // Used for price/duration range filtering\n}\n```\n\n**Common Assertions:**\n- `expect(page.getByTestId(...)).toBeVisible()`\n- `expect(page.getByTestId(...)).toContainText(...)`\n- `expect(page).toHaveURL(/pattern/)`\n- `expect(element).toHaveCount(n)` for lists\n- `expect(priceArray[i]).toBeGreaterThanOrEqual(priceArray[i-1])` for sorting\n\n---\n\n### 10. REDUX STATE STRUCTURE\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/slices/flightsSlice.ts`\n\n**FlightResult interface:**\n```typescript\ninterface FlightResult {\n  id, flight_number, departure_time, arrival_time, duration_minutes,\n  aircraft_type, has_wifi, has_power, has_entertainment, co2_kg,\n  airline_name, airline_code, logo_color,\n  origin_code, origin_name, origin_city,\n  dest_code, dest_name, dest_city,\n  total_price_cents, base_price_cents, taxes_cents, cabin_class,\n  available_seats, num_legs\n}\n```\n\n**FlightLeg interface:**\n```typescript\ninterface FlightLeg {\n  id, leg_order, departure_time, arrival_time, duration_minutes,\n  flight_number, aircraft_type, terminal_departure, terminal_arrival,\n  origin_code, origin_name, origin_city,\n  dest_code, dest_name, dest_city,\n  airline_name, airline_code\n}\n```\n\n**Filter State:**\n- `sortBy`: 'best' | 'price' | 'duration' | 'departure' | 'arrival'\n- `stopsFilter`: { nonstop, oneStop, twoPlusStops }\n- `airlinesFilter`: string[] (airline codes)\n- `priceRange`: [min, max] cents\n- `durationRange`: [min, max] minutes\n- `departureTimeFilter`: { morning, afternoon, evening, night }\n- `arrivalTimeFilter`: { morning, afternoon, evening, night }\n\n---\n\n### 11. PAGES & COMPONENTS OVERVIEW\n\n**SearchPage.tsx** - Home page with:\n- TripTypeSelector\n- PassengerCountSelector\n- CabinClassSelector\n- AirportAutocomplete (origin/destination with swap)\n- DatePicker (departure/return)\n- SearchButton\n- RecentSearches section\n- PopularDestinations grid\n\n**SearchResultsPage.tsx** - Results with:\n- SearchSummaryBar (inline editable chips)\n- FilterSidebar (left sidebar)\n- Flight results list (FlightResultCard components)\n- Pagination (Load more button)\n- TrackPricesToggle\n\n**FlightDetailsPage.tsx** - Booking page with:\n- FlightSummary (selected flight details)\n- PriceBreakdown (per-passenger pricing)\n- PassengerForm (personal info collection)\n- BookingAction (confirmation button)\n\n**MyTripsPage.tsx** - Trip management with:\n- TripsTabs (Upcoming/Past/Tracked)\n- TripCard (booking display)\n- TrackedRouteCard (price tracking)\n- CancelBookingModal\n\n**ExplorePage.tsx** - Discovery page with:\n- DealsSection\n- FlexibleDatesGrid\n- DestinationMap\n- PopularDestinations\n\n---\n\n### FILE LOCATIONS SUMMARY\n\n**Key Source Files:**\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/FilterSidebar.tsx` (355 lines)\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/FlightResultCard.tsx` (262 lines)\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/Pagination.tsx` (36 lines)\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/SearchSummaryBar.tsx` (249+ lines)\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/pages/SearchResultsPage.tsx` (252+ lines)\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/slices/flightsSlice.ts` (500+ lines)\n\n**Test Specs:**\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/docs/tests.md` (1000+ lines)\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/tests/filter-sidebar.spec.ts` (396 lines)\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/tests/search-summary-bar.spec.ts` (261 lines)\n\n**Configuration:**\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/playwright.config.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/package.json`\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/vite.config.ts`\n\n**Database & Scripts:**\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/scripts/seed-db.ts` (319 lines)\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/netlify/functions/search-flights.ts`\n\nThis is a complete, production-like Google Flights clone with comprehensive testing infrastructure, real-world data patterns, and complex filtering/sorting logic!"}],"totalDurationMs":92115,"totalTokens":84260,"totalToolUseCount":25,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":710,"cache_re